## Correlation Logic

CORR-001 classifies security telemetry into existing detection categories.

It then counts the number of distinct detection categories present within the correlation window.

Trigger condition:

```text
Distinct Detection Categories >= 3
```

Conceptually:

```text
DET-002
   +
DET-006
   +
DET-003
   +
DET-004
   +
DET-005
   |
   v
CORR-001
```

